      "text": {
        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\"><span style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;\"><span style=\"display:table-row;\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:5px;width:1px;\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faction\" title=\"Neutral\"><img alt=\"Neutral\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/19/Neutral_32.png/revision/latest?cb=20110620212507\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Neutral 32.png\" data-image-key=\"Neutral_32.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:2px;\">Countess Ashmore</span></span></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/d/d7/Countess_Ashmore.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180411144839\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Image of Countess Ashmore\"><img alt=\"Image of Countess Ashmore\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/d/d7/Countess_Ashmore.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20180411144839\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"158\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Countess Ashmore.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Countess_Ashmore.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nFemale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Blue_dragon\" title=\"Blue dragon\">Blue dragon</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Location</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Blackwald\" title=\"Blackwald\">Witchwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_peninsula\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gilneas peninsula\">Gilneas</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"background:transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding-right: 1em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hearthstone_(game)\" title=\"Hearthstone (game)\"><img alt=\"Hearthlogo\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hearthlogo.png\" data-image-key=\"Hearthlogo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/d/d1/Hearthlogo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20171221082913\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding-right: 1em;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 1ex; padding: 0.3ex 1em; border-top: 1px #808080 solid; border-bottom: 1px #808080 solid;\">\n<p><small><b>This article contains information and lore exclusive to <i><a href=\"/wiki/Hearthstone_(game)\" title=\"Hearthstone (game)\">Hearthstone</a></i>, and is considered <a href=\"/wiki/Canon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Canon\">non-canon</a>.</b></small>\n</p>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin: calc(0.5em + 1vh) auto calc(0.5em + 1vh) min(24px, calc(15px + 1.25%)); max-width:calc(70% + 15em)\">\n<div style=\"font-style:italic\">\n<p>“1 minion... ah, ah, ah! 2 minions... ah, ah, ah! 3 minions... ah, ah, ah!”\n</p>\n</div>\n<dl><dd>— Flavor text</dd></dl></div>\n<p><b>Countess Ashmore</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_dragon\" title=\"Blue dragon\">blue dragon</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> featured in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Hearthstone:_The_Witchwood\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hearthstone: The Witchwood\">The Witchwood</a></i> expansion for <i><a href=\"/wiki/Hearthstone_(game)\" title=\"Hearthstone (game)\">Hearthstone</a></i>.\n</p><p>The countess is an enigma, and no one in <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_peninsula\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gilneas peninsula\">Gilneas</a> seems to have heard of her noble line prior to the Witchwood curse, but suddenly, the records show an Ashmore family tree stretching all the way back to pre-<a href=\"/wiki/Alliance_of_Lordaeron\" title=\"Alliance of Lordaeron\">Alliance</a> days, written in a hand none of the royal scribes recognize. She's taken up residence in an old manor that's been abandoned since before the first battle of Gilneas, but while some claim that many voices can be heard emerging from the old estate, she's the only one who's been seen entering or leaving. It's rumored that Ashmore is researching the curse, and she has been asking questions of those who claim to have witnessed dragons in the wood. It is not clear if Ashmore is truly the scion of a forgotten noble family returned home in a time of need, or if she is something much more dangerous.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quotes\">Quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dt>Summon</dt>\n<dd>My power over you grows stronger yet.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>Attack</dt>\n<dd>Give in!</dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Her summon quote references the text of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Phantom_of_the_Opera_(Andrew_Lloyd_Webber_song)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:The Phantom of the Opera (Andrew Lloyd Webber song)\">The Phantom of the Opera (Andrew Lloyd Webber song)</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:calc(80% + 2.1px);\"><div style=\"margin-top:-0.3em; margin-bottom:0px; height:0px\">&#160;</div><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://twitter.com/LegendaryFerret/status/1020006418097639425\">Peter Whalen on Twitter</a>&#32;(2018-07-19).&#32;Retrieved on 2018-07-20.&#8203; “<i>She's a blue dragon.  Good luck with the cosplay!</i>”</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blizzard_Entertainment\" title=\"Blizzard Entertainment\"><img alt=\"Blizzard Entertainment\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/20/Blizz.gif/revision/latest?cb=20171007185539\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blizz.gif\" data-image-key=\"Blizz.gif\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daxxarri\" title=\"Daxxarri\">Daxxarri</a>&#32;2018-04-11.&#32;<a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://playhearthstone.com/en-gb/blog/21656013\">The Witchwood – Mysterious Missives Part 1</a>.&#32;Retrieved on 2018-04-13.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hearthstone_(game)\" title=\"Hearthstone\"><img alt=\"Hearthstone\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon-Hearthstone-22x22.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon-Hearthstone-22x22.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/14/Icon-Hearthstone-22x22.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20180708194307\" /></a></span> <a href=\"https://hearthstone.fandom.com/wiki/Countess_Ashmore\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"hswiki:Countess Ashmore\">On the Hearthstone Wiki</a>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0;;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px;\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"nowraplinks mw-collapsible mw-autocollapse navbox-inner\" style=\"border-spacing:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;;\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\";\" class=\"navbox-title\" colspan=\"2\"><div class=\"noprint plainlinks hlist navbar mini\" style=\"\"><ul><li class=\"nv-view\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Dragonflightfooter\" title=\"Template:Dragonflightfooter\"><span title=\"View this template\" style=\";;background:none transparent;border:none;\">v</span></a></li><li class=\"nv-edit\"><a target=\"_self\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wowpedia.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Dragonflightfooter?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\" style=\";;background:none transparent;border:none;\">e</span></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"\" style=\"font-size:110%;\">\n<a href=\"/wiki/Dragon\" title=\"Dragon\">Dragons</a></div></th></tr><tr style=\"height:2px;\"><td></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\";;\">Primary dragon types</th><td style=\"text-align:left;border-